{title: Tujhe Sochta Hoon}
{artist: Pritam K K}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm] Tuje sochta hoon main,        [Bb] Shaam Oh subah
Iss se zyaada tujhe aur,        [G#] Chahoon to [Cm] kyaa
[Cm] Tere hi kayalon mein,        [Bb] Dooba raha
Iss se zyaada tujhe aur,        [G#] Chahoon to [Cm] kyaa
[Cm] Bas sare gham mein jana, sang hoon tere
[Bb] Har ek mausam mein jana, sang hoon tere,        [G#] Ab itne imtehan [G] na leh mere [Cm]
[Cm] Aaa sang hoon tere,        [Bb] Aaa sang hoon tere
[G#] Aaa [G] sang hoon tere [Cm],        [Cm] Meri dadkano mein hi [Bb] teri sadaa
Iss kadar tu meri [G#] rooh me [Cm] bas gayaa,        [Cm] Teri yaado se kab [Bb] raha main judaa
Waqt se pooch le, waqt [G#] mera [Cm] gawah,        [Cm] Bas sare gham mein jana, sang hoon tere
[Bb] Har ek mausam mein jana, sang hoon tere,        [G#] Ab itne imtehan [G] na leh mere [Cm]
[Cm] Aaa sang hoon tere,        [Bb] Aaa sang hoon tere
[G#] Aaa [G] sang hoon tere [Cm],        [Cm] Tu mera tikhana
[Gm] Mera ashiyana,        [Bb] Dhale shaam jab bhi
[G#] Mereh paas aana,        [Cm] Hai bahon mein rehnah
[Gm] Kahin abh naa jana,        [Bb] Hoon mehfooz in mein
[G#] Booraa hai zamana,        [Cm] Bas sare gham mein jana, sang hoon tere
[Bb] Har ek mausam mein jana, sang hoon tere,        [G#] Ab itne imtehan [G] na leh mere [Cm]
[Cm] Aaa sang hoon tere,        [Bb] Aaa sang hoon tere
